    <bpmn:process id="W_W3323" name="W3323. Store/Team Performance Bonus &amp; Gainshare Plan Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual plan; store-performance cycle
Frequency: Monthly/quarterly payout
Volume: 200 stores × ~29 staff (per profile §12.1)
Owner: Compensation &amp; Benefits Manager
Participants: C&amp;B Manager, Store Ops (links to VS-07), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Payroll (links to VS-19.2), Store Managers
Source: workflow W3323 — Store/Team Performance Bonus &amp; Gainshare Plan Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3323_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3323_Lane1" name="C&amp;B Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3323_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3323_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3323_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3323_Lane2" name="Store Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3323_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3323_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3323_Start4" name="Annual plan; store-performance cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3323_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3323_Task5" name="C&amp;B Manager/Store Ops design store/team bonus and gainshare plans: measures…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: C&amp;B Manager/Store Ops design store/team bonus and gainshare plans: measures (sales per store, margin, shrink control links to VS-23, inventory accuracy links to VS-05.1, customer satisfaction links to VS-13), weighting, and payout
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Store Ops
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3323_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3323_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3323_Task6" name="Store Ops/Finance compute store/team performance vs targets (links to VS-33.2)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store Ops/Finance compute store/team performance vs targets (links to VS-33.2), allocate bonus pool by store ranking, and approve payouts within budget (W3327); manage fairness across store formats/clusters (links to VS-101.2 W3302)
Responsible (R): Store Ops / Finance
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3323_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3323_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3323_Task7" name="Payroll (links to VS-19.2) executes payout; C&amp;B Manager track store-bonus cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Payroll (links to VS-19.2) executes payout; C&amp;B Manager track store-bonus cost and effectiveness on store KPIs (shrink, accuracy, CSAT) and retention (W3328)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Payroll
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3323_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3323_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3323_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3323_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3323_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-537 (ensure controlled execution — Variable Pay, Incentives &amp; Total Rewards Strategy (PA-102.3).) | - operational: balanced measures and audit (links to VS-21); operational: like-for-like ranking
Owner: Compensation &amp; Benefits Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3323_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3323_Annotation9" targetRef="W3323_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
