        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-537 (ensure controlled execution — Variable Pay, Incentives &amp; Total Rewards Strategy (PA-102.3).) | - operational: award structure approved at the committee gate (step 2) with documented vesting and finance/legal review
Owner: CHRO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
