        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: C&amp;B Manager compile each employee&#x27;s total rewards: base pay, STI/LTI value, statutory employer contributions (W3314), HMO/medical (W3313), retirement (W3315), allowances (W3316), wellness/EAP (W3317), training (links to VS-19.4), and time-off value
