        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: C&amp;B Manager/Internal Comms generate personalized total-rewards statements and communicate the employee value proposition (EVP); deliver via employee self-service (links to VS-103.1) and onboarding (links to VS-19.1)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Internal Comms
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3325_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3325_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3325_Task6" name="C&amp;B Manager measure statement/EVP impact on engagement (links to VS-103.2) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: C&amp;B Manager measure statement/EVP impact on engagement (links to VS-103.2) and retention (W3328); refine messaging and offerings
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3325_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3325_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
