    <bpmn:process id="W_W3326" name="W3326. Recognition, Awards &amp; Service-Anniversary Program Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Nomination; anniversary; achievement
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: Enterprise-wide recognition events
Owner: Compensation &amp; Benefits Manager
Participants: C&amp;B Manager, HRBP, Managers, Employees, Internal Comms (links to VS-103.2), Payroll (links to VS-19.2)
Source: workflow W3326 — Recognition, Awards &amp; Service-Anniversary Program Operations</bpmn:documentation>
