        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: C&amp;B Manager design/maintain recognition programs (peer-to-peer, manager awards, service anniversaries, spot awards, values awards); set criteria, nomination workflow, and budget (W3327)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3326_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3326_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
