        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Managers/peers nominate and approve recognition; C&amp;B Manager administer awards (monetary via payroll links to VS-19.2, non-monetary, ceremonies), service-anniversary milestones, and communication (links to VS-103.2)
Responsible (R): Managers / C&amp;B Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3326_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3326_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3326_Task7" name="C&amp;B Manager track recognition participation/equity across stores/roles, measure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: C&amp;B Manager track recognition participation/equity across stores/roles, measure engagement impact (links to VS-103.2), and report program effectiveness (W3328)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3326_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3326_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
