    <bpmn:process id="W_W3328" name="W3328. Total Rewards Effectiveness, Engagement-Link &amp; Retention Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual review; turnover trigger (links to VS-19.5)
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Workforce analytics
Owner: Compensation &amp; Benefits Manager
Participants: C&amp;B Manager, People Analytics (links to VS-103.3), CHRO, BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3328 — Total Rewards Effectiveness, Engagement-Link &amp; Retention Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3328_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3328_Lane1" name="C&amp;B Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3328_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3328_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3328_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3328_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3328_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3328_Start3" name="Annual review; turnover trigger (links to VS-19.5)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3328_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3328_Task4" name="C&amp;B Manager/People Analytics measure total-rewards effectiveness: pay…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: C&amp;B Manager/People Analytics measure total-rewards effectiveness: pay competitiveness vs market (W3308), pay-equity (W3309), benefits utilization/satisfaction (W3320), incentive ROI (W3321/W3322/W3323), and recognition reach (W3326)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / People Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3328_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3328_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3328_Task5" name="C&amp;B Manager/People Analytics correlate rewards with engagement (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: C&amp;B Manager/People Analytics correlate rewards with engagement (links to VS-103.2) and turnover/retention (links to VS-19.5/VS-103.3), identifying reward drivers of attrition (especially regrettable loss) and high-performer retention
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / People Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3328_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3328_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3328_Task6" name="C&amp;B Manager recommend program adjustments (reallocate spend to high-impact…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: C&amp;B Manager recommend program adjustments (reallocate spend to high-impact rewards), report total-rewards effectiveness to CHRO/CFO and committee (links to VS-36), and update the rewards strategy
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3328_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3328_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3328_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3328_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3328_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-537 (ensure controlled execution — Variable Pay, Incentives &amp; Total Rewards Strategy (PA-102.3).) | - operational: analytics; operational: retention analytics
Owner: Compensation &amp; Benefits Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
